  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "淨零碳排與企業永續轉型",
    "sub_ename": "NET ZERO & CORPORATE SUSTAINABILITY TRANSFORMATION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程聚焦於碳中和時代下的企業永續轉型策略，整合永續發展基本理論、碳盤查實務操作與企業轉型經驗分享三大主軸。課程內容涵蓋 ESG 架構、碳盤查標準（ISO 14064、GHG Protocol）、碳足跡估算、SBTi、TCFD、淨零承諾實施策略等，並由碳盤查專家進行實務教學，企業總經理親自分享推動永續轉型的挑戰與路徑。學生將透過案例討論、數據模擬與提案設計，建立跨部門永續溝通與淨零實踐能力，適合未來投身企業永續、碳管理顧問或 ESG 策略相關職涯之學生修習。",
    "describe_eh": "This course focuses on corporate sustainability transformation in the era of net zero, combining fundamental ESG theories, carbon accounting practices, and real-world executive experience. Topics include ESG frameworks, ISO 14064, GHG Protocol, carbon footprint estimation, Science-Based Targets (SBTi), and TCFD disclosures. The course features hands-on workshops led by a carbon management specialist and in-depth industry insights shared by a corporate executive with sustainability transformation experience. Students will engage in case analysis, data simulations, and strategic proposal development to strengthen their capabilities in ESG planning, cross-functional communication, and net-zero implementation. Ideal for students pursuing careers in sustainability, carbon consulting, or corporate ESG leadership.",
